{"candidateAnswer":"A wide range of outdoor sports and creative activities","evidence":"[D1:14 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Evan: Yep, it's a great stress-buster. I started doing this a few years back.\n[D1:6 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Evan: We all hiked the trails last week - the views were amazing!\n[D4:8 | 10:52 am on 27 July, 2023] Evan: Go for it, Sam! It's tough at first, but you got this. Try flavored seltzer water instead. It can be a great alternative to soda. Btw I can't stop thinking about that new mystery novel I started. It's so gripping!\n[D6:1 | 4:09 pm on 13 August, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, long time no talk! Hope you're doing great. I just got back from a rad vacay with my new SO in Canada. Tried some awesome activities too - think hiking, biking... all that cool stuff. We loved exploring the outdoors together, it was so awesome!\n[D8:30 | 6:17 pm on 19 August, 2023] Evan: Skiing, snowboarding, and ice skating are all fun winter activities I enjoy.\n[D9:6 | 10:18 am on 27 August, 2023] Evan: Yeah, PT for my knee is on the cards. Hopefully I'll get an appointment soon. Till then, just keeping it low-key and swimming to stay active.\n[D25:8 | 9:37 pm on 11 January, 2024] Evan: Glad to hear it! Nature really has a way of calming and reviving the soul. Last summer, I took this pic on a camping trip - it was such an amazing sunset. Moments like these remind us of the beauty of life, even during tough times.\n[D25:10 | 9:37 pm on 11 January, 2024] Evan: I had a great time kayaking and watching the sunset last summer - it was truly unforgettable. Being out on the water is so peaceful.","itemId":"urn:uuid:a14fd2e8-4fc0-593b-9be1-d8b2f9aacc3e","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:7227a12eb1e6666a31cdc2047a423d6307915f9de4ef8b1147ce8e65314c2d5f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of hobbies does Evan pursue?","referenceAnswer":"painting, hiking, reading books, biking, skiing, snowboarding, ice skating, swimming, camping, kayaking","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"7227a12eb1e6666a31cdc2047a423d6307915f9de4ef8b1147ce8e65314c2d5f"}}]}